ptotic Genes as Targetable Mediators of Chemotherapy Resistance in Ovarian Cancer", "relation": "IsSupplementTo", "identifier_type": "DOI", "is_linkout": true, "link": "https://doi.org/10.1158/1541-7786.MCR-18-1243"}], "is_embargoed": false, "embargo_date": null, "embargo_type": null, "embargo_title": "", "embargo_reason": "", "embargo_options": [], "id": 22512706, "title": "Supplementary Table S4 from Pooled Genomic Screens Identify Anti-apoptotic Genes as Targetable Mediators of Chemotherapy Resistance in Ovarian Cancer", "doi": "10.1158/1541-7786.22512706.v1", "handle": "", "url": "https://api.figshare.com/v2/articles/22512706", "published_date": "2023-04-03T16:43:01Z", "thumb": "", "defined_type": 3, "defined_type_name": "dataset", "group_id": 46216, "url_private_api": "https://api.figshare.com/v2/account/articles/22512706", "url_public_api": "https://api.figshare.com/v2/articles/22512706", "url_private_html": "https://figshare.com/account/articles/22512706", "url_public_html": "https://aacr.figshare.com/articles/dataset/Supplementary_Table_S4_from_Pooled_Genomic_Screens_Identify_Anti-apoptotic_Genes_as_Targetable_Mediators_of_Chemotherapy_Resistance_in_Ovarian_Cancer/22512706", "timeline": {"posted": "2023-04-03T16:43:01", "publisherPublication": "2019-11-01T00:00:00", "firstOnline": "2023-04-03"}, "resource_title": "Pooled Genomic Screens Identify Anti-apoptotic Genes as Targetable Mediators of Chemotherapy Resistance in Ovarian Cancer", "resource_doi": "10.1158/1541-7786.MCR-18-1243"}